            "summary": "cheerful cheesemonger and useful coward. Role: market gossip, cart owner, witness who fled at the right time. Immediate want: retrieve a cheese cart seized under impossible poultry regulations. Hidden depth: saw the empty tax wagon arrive; suspects the driver left willingly; hides that he transported one unlisted passenger.",
            "visibility": "party"
          }
        }
      ],
